Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos mamatay minsan, wala na akong limitasyon.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mananakaw pa ng suitor ng bestie ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:04.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mukhang walang prinsip nga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:08.21,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kaso pagkatapos mamatay nang isang beses,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:12.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang prinsip ko na ang pinakamura sa lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi kulang si Song Jingyi sa manliligaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Guwapo, fit, mayaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:18.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,At mga tutulong sa pag-aaral niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo madali mong mabihag 'yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kahit hindi ako ang piliin ni Jingyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:24.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi ikaw ang karapat-dapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Akala ko pangit ka lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Yun pala, walangya pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako? Walangya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Magkakursmate tayo sa sports dept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:30.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Alam mong best friend ako ni Jingyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,nagpapanggap kang nag-aalala sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:32.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,nagbibigay ng malisyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,para maka-approach kay Jingyi through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sino ang unang gumamit kanino?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mukhang tanga si Mi Ke,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,pero nabasa niya ang iniisip ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:39.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Jiang Muyi.
